{"seq":1,"slug":"constraint-rule-engine-architecture","title":"约束规则引擎架构：规则 DSL、互斥与依赖求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/constraint-rule-engine-architecture","wordCount":3804,"readingTime":16,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束规则引擎架构-规则-dsl-互斥与依赖求解\">约束规则引擎架构：规则 DSL、互斥与依赖求解</h1><p>在按需定制（made-to-order）场景里，买家一改颜色，手柄的兼容选项、可选的雕刻文案、加价幅度和交货周期就全部变了。配置器表面上是几个下拉框，底下是一台<strong>约束求解器</strong>：它必须保证「任何被允许提交的组合，工厂都能造出来」，同时把堆积如山的互斥与依赖规则压缩成一次几毫秒的求值。本文拆开这台机器的三层——规则的表达（DSL）、约束的形式化（互斥 / 依赖）、以及求解策略（BDD / SAT / CP）——并给出跨境定制商品真正会踩的坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>配置问题的本质是「从合法组合空间里挑一个点」。设一套产品有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个可配置特征，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个特征有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|D_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 个取值，则笛卡尔积空间大小是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Omega| = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |D_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Ω∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一台笔记本电脑若有 CPU(5) × 内存(4) × 硬盘(6) × 显卡(3) × 屏幕(4) × 键盘语言(12) 六个特征，空间就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>17280</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\times4\\times6\\times3\\times4\\times12 = 17280</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17280</span></span></span></span></span>；一旦加上接口扩展、保修年限、预装软件这些跨境常有的本地化选项，特征到十几、空间到百万级是常态。<strong>规则引擎的全部工作，就是从这百万级空间里剔除不可行（infeasible）与不允许（forbidden）的组合，并让剩下的空间对用户可导航。</strong></p>\n<p>形式化地，配置任务是一个约束满足问题（CSP）：变量集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>、定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、约束集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，记作</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>解集</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊨</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = (X, D, C), \\quad \\text{解集} \\; \\Omega = \\{a \\in D \\mid a \\models C\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解集</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.999em;vertical-align:-0.249em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套 CSP 建模是知识型配置研究的标准起点（Felfernig 等，<em>Knowledge-based Configuration: From Research to Business Cases</em>, Morgan Kaufmann, 2014）。工程上真正难的从来不是求解算法本身，而是三件事：<strong>规则怎么写人才能维护</strong>（DSL）、<strong>约束怎么表达才不丢语义</strong>（互斥 / 依赖 / 基数）、<strong>出错时怎么告诉用户和运维哪里坏了</strong>（可诊断性）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  M[产品模型&lt;br/&gt;特征 / 组件 / 150% BOM] --&gt; DSL[规则 DSL 层]&#10;  DSL --&gt; C1[互斥 excludes]&#10;  DSL --&gt; C2[依赖 requires]&#10;  DSL --&gt; C3[基数 / 条件约束]&#10;  C1 --&gt; COMP[编译器&lt;br/&gt;归一化 + 校验]&#10;  C2 --&gt; COMP&#10;  C3 --&gt; COMP&#10;  COMP --&gt; SOLVE[求解器&lt;br/&gt;BDD / SAT / CP-SAT]&#10;  SOLVE --&gt; NAV[引导式销售&lt;br/&gt;可选值裁剪 + 默认值]&#10;  SOLVE --&gt; CHECK[可满足性 / 冲突解释]\">graph TD\n  M[产品模型&lt;br/&gt;特征 / 组件 / 150% BOM] --&gt; DSL[规则 DSL 层]\n  DSL --&gt; C1[互斥 excludes]\n  DSL --&gt; C2[依赖 requires]\n  DSL --&gt; C3[基数 / 条件约束]\n  C1 --&gt; COMP[编译器&lt;br/&gt;归一化 + 校验]\n  C2 --&gt; COMP\n  C3 --&gt; COMP\n  COMP --&gt; SOLVE[求解器&lt;br/&gt;BDD / SAT / CP-SAT]\n  SOLVE --&gt; NAV[引导式销售&lt;br/&gt;可选值裁剪 + 默认值]\n  SOLVE --&gt; CHECK[可满足性 / 冲突解释]</pre><p>跨境场景给这套抽象加了三重约束，值得在设计时先想清楚。<strong>其一是物理可行性</strong>：定制的雕刻文案若含当地禁售符号、或材质不符合目的地国合规要求，规则层必须在下单前拒掉，而不是等工厂发现造不出。<strong>其二是退货的法律边界</strong>：欧盟《消费者权利指令》2011/83/EU 第 16(c) 条将「按消费者规格制造或明显个性化的商品」排除在 14 天无理由退货之外（EUR-Lex, Directive 2011/83/EU），「个性化」的判定必须在配置时落库——它决定这笔订单是否可退，而不只是视觉上好看。<strong>其三是多工厂能力差异</strong>：同一 SKU 由佛山与越南两厂出货时可选项集合不同，规则引擎要按「工厂能力」维度二次裁剪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则-dsl-的表达形态与编译\">规则 DSL 的表达形态与编译</h2><p>主流 CPQ 系统给出的规则 DSL 几乎都能归入四个动作原语，差别只在语法糖与校验强度。SAP Variant Configuration 的说法最经典：<strong>前提条件</strong>（precondition，某特征值组合成立时该值才可选）、<strong>选择条件</strong>（selection condition，选中某值后自动带出/锁定别的值）、<strong>程序</strong>（procedure，选中后执行一段副作用，如推导加价或改 BOM 行）、以及<strong>约束</strong>（constraint，跨整个配置、对所有配置全局成立的布尔断言）（SAP Help, <em>Dependencies</em>，help.sap.com）。Salesforce CPQ 把产品规则拆成 Validation / Selection / Alert / Subscription 四类，其中 Validation 在保存时阻塞、Selection 自动增删行项（Salesforce, <em>Product Rules</em> 文档）。Oracle CPQ 则把「约束规则」与「修改规则」分开，前者管可行性、后者管联动。</p>\n<p>DSL 的价值不在于语法像不像自然语言，而在于<strong>能不能被静态校验</strong>。一条写得漂亮的规则若引用了不存在的特征码、或把字符串和数值混着比较，应该在发布前被编译器拒绝。因此规则 DSL 的编译链路通常是：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解析</td>\n<td>DSL 文本 / 表格</td>\n<td>抽象语法树</td>\n<td>语法错误、未知特征码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>AST + 特征 schema</td>\n<td>类型一致的 AST</td>\n<td>字符串与数值比较、枚举越界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化</td>\n<td>类型化 AST</td>\n<td>受限形式约束（CNF / 决策表）</td>\n<td>表达式无法归约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局校验</td>\n<td>约束集合</td>\n<td>冲突 / 死规则报告</td>\n<td>规则矛盾、恒假规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译</td>\n<td>归一化约束</td>\n<td>BDD / 子句集 / CP 模型</td>\n<td>编译膨胀、超时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>归一化是这一层最被低估的步骤。</strong> 任意布尔表达式必须先化到求解器能吃的形式：BDD 路线要有序化变量并按变量序构建；SAT 路线通常化到合取范式（CNF）；CP 路线保留到全局约束层面、交给传播器。归一化做得好不好直接决定求解性能上限——同一个模型换一种变量排序，BDD 规模可能差几个数量级。</p>\n<p>决策表是 DSL 的另一条常见形态，也是业务方能直接评审的形式。OMG 的 DMN（Decision Model and Notation）把「一行一规则、一列一条件」的决策表标准化，并规定六种命中策略：<code>UNIQUE</code>（最多一行命中）、<code>FIRST</code>（按行序取首条）、<code>PRIORITY</code>（取输出优先级最高者）、<code>OUTPUT ORDER</code>、<code>RULE ORDER</code>、<code>COLLECT</code>（汇总所有命中输出）（OMG, <em>DMN Specification</em>, omg.org/spec/DMN）。把互斥/依赖规则写成 <code>PRIORITY</code> 决策表，比写成一堆 <code>if-else</code> 更易审计——跨境合规（同一套产品要满足多国规则）时几乎是刚需。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互斥与依赖的形式化-从-if-then-到-csp\">互斥与依赖的形式化：从 if-then 到 CSP</h2><p>把自然语言的规则翻译成布尔约束，只有少数几个原语，但它们<strong>语义绝不能混</strong>。最常见的三类是：</p>\n<p><strong>互斥（mutual exclusion / excludes）</strong>：两个选项不能同时被选。设布尔变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「选了 A」「选了 B」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>≡</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neg(a \\land b) \\quad\\equiv\\quad \\neg a \\lor \\neg b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但「互斥」在业务上有两种强度，混淆它们会出大问题。<strong>成对互斥</strong>是说 A 与 B 两两不能共存（如金属漆与哑光漆）；<strong>分组单选（single-select group）</strong> 是说整组至多/恰好选一个：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>恰好一个</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>至多一个</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i \\in S} x_i = 1 \\quad(\\text{恰好一个}), \\qquad \\sum_{i \\in S} x_i \\le 1 \\quad(\\text{至多一个})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">恰好一个</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">至多一个</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>成对互斥无法表达「从 5 个配件里挑最多 2 个」这种基数语义，必须用基数约束。把成对互斥强行堆砌来模拟基数，是配置模型最常见的规模灾难。</p>\n<p><strong>依赖（requires / implication）</strong>：选了 A 就必须选 B：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>≡</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\Rightarrow b \\quad\\equiv\\quad \\neg a \\lor b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意依赖<strong>有方向、无传递闭包保证</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\Rightarrow b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\Rightarrow c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\Rightarrow c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是逻辑上的必然，但若只配了前两条而没配第三条，求解器仍会正确推出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\Rightarrow c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>——然而<strong>产品的 BOM 与报价却不会自动跟着传播</strong>。这是「逻辑正确、业务错误」的典型：约束层说可行，报价层却少算了一个组件。所以依赖关系必须与 BOM 展开、价格推导用同一份规则源，而不是各写一份。</p>\n<p><strong>条件约束（conditional constraint）</strong>：只有当前提成立时某约束才生效：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>地区</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>EU</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>某材质</mtext></msub><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>合规认证</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\text{地区} = \\text{EU}) \\Rightarrow (x_{\\text{某材质}} \\Rightarrow x_{\\text{合规认证}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">地区</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EU</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">某材质</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">合规认证</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这本质上把规则本身也参数化了，是跨境多国合规的核心表达方式。</p>\n<p>把这三类翻译成 CSP，就是标准的「变量 + 定义域 + 约束」三元组。区别在于：<strong>互斥与依赖是二元约束</strong>（作用于两个变量），<strong>基数与条件约束是全局约束</strong>（作用于变量集合）。求解器处理全局约束的效率通常远高于把它们拆成一堆二元约束——CP 求解器有专门的基数传播器，SAT 侧则可用序贯编码（sequential encoding）或基数网络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[用户改选 特征 F = v] --&gt; P[传播 propagation]&#10;  P --&gt; R1{违反互斥?}&#10;  R1 --&gt;|是| BK[回退: 该值不可选]&#10;  R1 --&gt;|否| R2{触发依赖&lt;br/&gt;requires?}&#10;  R2 --&gt;|是| AUTO[自动勾选被依赖值]&#10;  AUTO --&gt; P&#10;  R2 --&gt;|否| R3{基数约束&lt;br/&gt;仍可满足?}&#10;  R3 --&gt;|否| BK&#10;  R3 --&gt;|是| OK[更新可选值集合&lt;br/&gt;重算价格/交期]&#10;  BK --&gt; EXPL[生成冲突解释]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[用户改选 特征 F = v] --&gt; P[传播 propagation]\n  P --&gt; R1{违反互斥?}\n  R1 --&gt;|是| BK[回退: 该值不可选]\n  R1 --&gt;|否| R2{触发依赖&lt;br/&gt;requires?}\n  R2 --&gt;|是| AUTO[自动勾选被依赖值]\n  AUTO --&gt; P\n  R2 --&gt;|否| R3{基数约束&lt;br/&gt;仍可满足?}\n  R3 --&gt;|否| BK\n  R3 --&gt;|是| OK[更新可选值集合&lt;br/&gt;重算价格/交期]\n  BK --&gt; EXPL[生成冲突解释]</pre><p>这张图暴露了一个工程要点：<strong>配置器不是「先收集全部选择、最后求解一次」，而是每改一个值就增量传播一次。</strong> 用户每点一下都要在 10–50ms 内返回「哪些值还可选、当前价格是多少」，这要求求解器支持增量求解与回溯，而不是每次从头解。增量传播做不好，配置器就会在高特征数下卡顿——这是 CPQ 系统被投诉最多的性能问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"求解策略-bdd-sat-与-cp-sat-的取舍\">求解策略：BDD、SAT 与 CP-SAT 的取舍</h2><p>同一份约束集合，工程上有三条主流求解路线，各有明确的适用区间。</p>\n<p><strong>BDD（有序二元决策图）路线</strong>是最「编译派」的做法。它把整个约束模型一次性编译成一个有序 BDD，之后任何查询（某个部分配置有多少可行扩展、某值是否可选）都退化成在图上的线性遍历，<strong>求解时间与配置空间大小无关</strong>——这是它最大的卖点。Configit 的 <em>Virtual Tabulation</em> 正是这一类技术，声称可处理数百万至数十亿组合的配置空间（Configit, configit.com）。代价是<strong>编译时间与 BDD 规模对变量序极度敏感</strong>：变量排序选得差，BDD 节点数可能指数膨胀，编译本身就跑不完。所以 BDD 路线适合「模型稳定、查询极频繁」的场景——电商前台就是典型。</p>\n<p><strong>SAT / 子句求解路线</strong>把约束化到 CNF，用成熟的 CDCL SAT 求解器判断可满足性、并借极小不可满足子集（MUS）提取冲突解释。它的优势是<strong>工具链成熟、增量求解（假设下的增量 SAT）支持好</strong>，缺点是可满足性是布尔答案，<strong>不直接给「哪些值可选」</strong>——要知道某值是否有可行扩展，得对每个候选值各解一次（或用模型计数技术）。对特征数中等的配置器，SAT 是性价比很高的选择。</p>\n<p><strong>CP / CP-SAT 路线</strong>（约束编程）保留变量的定义域语义，用传播 + 回溯搜索。Google OR-Tools 的 CP-SAT 求解器提供了基数、表、蕴含等全局约束，是当前开源侧最常被引用的选择（Google, <em>OR-Tools CP-SAT Solver</em>, developers.google.com/optimization）。CP 的强项是<strong>表达能力</strong>：它能自然地把「选中的组件总价不超过预算」「加起来的重量不超过整箱上限」这类数值约束塞进同一个模型，而 BDD/SAT 处理数值约束要额外编码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>BDD（编译派）</th>\n<th>SAT / CNF</th>\n<th>CP / CP-SAT</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询延迟</td>\n<td>极低，与空间无关</td>\n<td>中，需逐值求解</td>\n<td>中，传播后查域</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译/建模成本</td>\n<td>高，对变量序敏感</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值约束</td>\n<td>需编码，笨拙</td>\n<td>需编码，笨拙</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突解释</td>\n<td>需额外机制</td>\n<td>MUS 成熟</td>\n<td>有专门冲突分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量求解</td>\n<td>结构上天然支持</td>\n<td>增量 SAT 支持好</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>前台高频配置</td>\n<td>中等规模校验</td>\n<td>含价格的复杂模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的经验法则：<strong>前台面向消费者的可选项裁剪用 BDD（或预编译的等价结构），后台的订单可行性校验、工厂能力匹配、含成本约束的报价求解用 CP-SAT。</strong> 两者可从同一份规则源编译出两份产物——这也是前面强调归一化层要独立存在的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则治理-冲突检测-死规则与可诊断性\">规则治理：冲突检测、死规则与可诊断性</h2><p>一套 500 条的规则集合，写下第一版不难，难的是<strong>它是否自洽</strong>。规则引擎必须能在发布前回答四个问题，否则上线就是事故。</p>\n<p><strong>模型可满足吗？</strong> 若约束集合本身矛盾（既要求又禁止同一组合），解集是空集，没有任何配置合法——用户会看到所有选项都灰掉。这类错误必须在 CI 阶段对约束集合求解一次捕获。<strong>有没有死规则？</strong> 一条规则的前件在当前模型下恒假，它就永远不会触发；跨境场景里这在「某国已下架的产品」上很常见，规则还挂着、产品却没了，运维会误以为规则在起作用。<strong>冲突怎么解释？</strong> 用户想选 A、系统只说「不行」是灾难，求解器必须给出<strong>极小冲突集</strong>——哪几条规则、哪几个已选值凑在一起导致不可行；SAT 侧的 MUS、CP 侧的冲突分析、BDD 侧的剪枝路径都能提供这份解释。<strong>规则改了会影响什么？</strong> 改一条规则可能让另一条从「活」变「死」，因此必须<strong>把线上历史订单的真实配置当作测试用例</strong>做全量回归，验证原本可行的仍可行、原本被禁的仍被禁——没有回归，规则库会随时间腐化成「没人敢动」的化石。</p>\n<p>配置器诊断研究还有一个更进一步诉求：<strong>不只告诉用户错在哪，而是给出修复建议</strong>（Felfernig 等关于配置诊断与修复的工作）。跨境定制里这条需求尤其真实——用户填的雕刻文案触发了某国禁售词，系统不该只说「不可用」，而应给出「该文案在你选择的配送国家受限，是否改用其他文案或切换配送地」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>配置问题就是 CSP：变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>、定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，解集是满足全部约束的组合集合；空间大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∏</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Omega| = \\prod |D_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Ω∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，跨境多特征场景轻易到百万级，规则引擎的任务是把不可行组合剔除并让剩余空间可导航。</li>\n<li>规则 DSL 的价值在可静态校验：解析 → 类型检查 → 归一化 → 全局校验 → 编译，任何一环缺失都会让错误规则溜到生产。DMN 决策表（含 <code>UNIQUE</code>/<code>FIRST</code>/<code>PRIORITY</code>/<code>COLLECT</code> 等命中策略）是业务方可直接评审的规则形态。</li>\n<li>互斥要区分<strong>成对互斥</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">¬</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\neg(a\\land b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">¬</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与<strong>基数约束</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum x_i \\le k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，用成对互斥模拟基数会造成规则规模灾难；依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\Rightarrow b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 在逻辑上自动传递，但 BOM 与报价不会跟着传播——规则源必须唯一。</li>\n<li>求解路线三选一：BDD 编译派查询极快但编译对变量序敏感（Configit Virtual Tabulation 一类），SAT 工具链成熟且 MUS 解释好但需逐值求解，CP-SAT 表达数值约束最强（OR-Tools）。前台裁剪用 BDD、后台校验用 CP-SAT 是常见组合。</li>\n<li>可诊断性是一等公民：能定位<strong>极小冲突集</strong>并给出修复建议的引擎，其客服成本远低于只会说「不可选」的引擎；用历史订单做全量回归，是防止规则库腐化的唯一手段。</li>\n<li>跨境定制的两条法律/物理边界必须进规则层：欧盟 2011/83/EU 第 16(c) 条将个性化商品排除在 14 天无理由退货外，「个性化」的判定要在配置时落库；多工厂能力差异要作为独立约束维度二次裁剪。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束规则引擎架构：规则 DSL、互斥与依赖求解","id":"约束规则引擎架构-规则-dsl-互斥与依赖求解"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规则 DSL 的表达形态与编译","id":"规则-dsl-的表达形态与编译"},{"level":2,"text":"互斥与依赖的形式化：从 if-then 到 CSP","id":"互斥与依赖的形式化-从-if-then-到-csp"},{"level":2,"text":"求解策略：BDD、SAT 与 CP-SAT 的取舍","id":"求解策略-bdd-sat-与-cp-sat-的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"规则治理：冲突检测、死规则与可诊断性","id":"规则治理-冲突检测-死规则与可诊断性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可配置产品主数据模型：父产品、BOM 与选项到物料的映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/customization-model-option-variants/configurable-product-catalog-data-model"},"next":{"title":"引导式销售与兼容推荐：从需求问答到可下单配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-customization-cpq-configurator-made-to-order/constraint-rules-cpq-guided-selling/guided-selling-recommendation-flow"}}